    {
      "type": "goal",
      "items": [
        "I can open a formal speech with appropriate vocatives and consistent ustedes pronouns and possessives.",
        "I can use courteous audience imperatives such as permítanme and consideren.",
        "I can avoid drifting between ustedes and tú during a formal address."
